      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with this. Blocking out the very user poor rank loses out on most avatars you see in normal day to day instances. Having a rank under very poor would be nice to block out avatars that are just terrible with performance. Adding a custom performance rank to adjust how you'd like your viewing experience to be would be even better rather than to be limited to only specific ranks.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
