  "details": "most of the avatars i see are very poor, but for only one or two small things like light source etc\ni usually have everyone very poor auto hidden, but i miss out on seeing a lot of ppls stuff. i think there should be a 'crippling/ horrible' perf stat for things that are just genuinely awful, like having over 500 particles, over 300 bones, over 200k polys etc stuff like that. also we really need to hunker down on teaching avatar creators (esp new ones) how to optimize and why its important, i meet a lot of creators that simply dont care that what they make is horrendous and thats so gross tbh",
